   "title": "A warning",
   "text": "You are Publius Quinctilius Varus, governor of Germany, with three legions. Segestes, a German noble, comes to you at dinner. He says Arminius, your trusted officer, is plotting against you, and he begs you to arrest them both, himself included.",
   "intel": {
    "hint": [
     {
      "text": "Segestes hates Arminius, who married his daughter against his will."
     }
    ],
    "scout": [
     {
      "text": "A man who asks to be arrested himself is not just settling a grudge. Arresting Arminius would take the head off any plot."
     }
